   "html": "<p>Universal Studios enlisted IHC to recreate Ma's House as the centerpiece of a week-long promotional campaign. The space served as the setting for a press junket, an influencer meet &amp; greet, and an immersive horror house party experience, while doubling as a content hub.</p>\n<p>The activation was met with rave reviews from attendees. <strong>Throughout the course of the night, 450+ guests attended the Horror House Party and nearly 100 influencer-level attendees posted during the event</strong>.</p>"
  }
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "PRESS JUNKET",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Three rooms were transformed inside the Beckett Mansion to serve as hero spaces for the press junket. Our work included conceptualizing and fully redecorating each of the rooms to match the set from <em>MA</em>. </p>"
    },
    {
     "type": "gallery",
     "media": [
      {
       "type": "image",
       "src": "/images/66a0959211d8e45ce2ce0e76_ma-gallery-1-1.webp",
