      {
       "type": "image",
       "src": "/images/6614cd1d994924784211c45c_case-studies-ma-press-junket-set-compressed-1800x-min.webp",
       "alt": ""
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "#PARTY WITH MA",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>We transported attendees to the high school ragers of Ma’s basement, creating a memorable night fueled by nostalgia. The space was decked out with string lights, kegs, beer pong tables, DJs, photo opps, and a food truck serving Pizza Bites. </p>",
     "right": "<p>With a cast of 25 actors, guests could never be too sure if they were talking to a fellow party-goer or someone in character. These actors started games of spin the bottle and flip cup, and they were always down to shotgun a beer.</p>"
    },
    {
