  {
   "title": "HORROR EXPERIENCE",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>The centerpiece of the evening was a horror experience, spanning 13 rooms across 3 floors<em></em>, incorporating elements from the film. The horror theater was fully immersive from start to finish. As guests wandered through the party, planted actors warned them of their potential fate at Ma's house.</p>",
     "right": "<p>Guests were invited to explore Ma’s basement which subsequently led them upstairs to discover things were definitely not as they seemed. Lasting about 10 minutes, guests were chased down the second floor stairs back into the main party.</p>"
    },
